7: Chapter 7: The Savory Corvisquire\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Corvisquire, one of Galar's most common bird Pok\u233?mon. Unlike other bird Pok\u233?mon, Corvisquire are known for their intelligence and ability to use tools for hunting.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As a proud Corvisquire, I am currently searching for a new habitat for my tribe. Our homeland has been overtaken by the sudden appearance of Skarmory, forcing us to leave.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If I evolve into Corviknight, I am confident that I can drive away those arrogant birds who rely on their armor.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
