"Grookey."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Despite its small size, Grookey effortlessly takes the birdhouse and climbs up the tree.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The birdhouse looks so luxurious. I want to move in! No, wait, what am I thinking? This might be a trap set by humans! I shake my head, suddenly noticing several Caterpie nearby, eyeing me greedily.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
How dare these mere insects act so arrogantly? Don't they understand the concept of species restraint?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
