After Grookey finishes hanging the birdhouse and climbs down, Summer addresses it:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Let's head home for today, Grookey."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Grookey swiftly climbs onto Summer's shoulder. They don't actually go home; instead, they hide behind a tree to observe my actions.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Seeing the human leave, I fly towards the birdhouse crafted by Summer. I cautiously stick my leg inside to check for traps. Once confirmed safe, I excitedly hop inside.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In my eyes, Summer's creation is a luxurious villa for bird Pok\u233?mon. Humans can do good things after all!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Next, I fly to a Coba Berry tree nearby, pecking at a ripe berry and devouring it. The delightful taste floods my senses once again. I indulge in three more berries.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
