Summer steps out from behind the tree, wearing a triumphant smile. He has no idea about my deep-seated grudges; he merely sees me as a wild Pok\u233?mon passing by.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
I open my beak wide. This human must have malicious intentions, but why do I feel such warmth?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
