"Ka!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
[Agreement reached.]\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Summer smiles. Although he doesn't understand my words, his assistant's words reassure him. The second step of ecological restoration is complete!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As for my words, here's a rough translation:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"So, there's only one answer: I will pledge my loyalty to you!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
(End of this chapter)\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} 
