23: Chapter 23: The Berries of Spikemuth\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At Spikemuth Restaurant, Grandpa Gideon savored a steaming cup of tea, looking content.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I'm used to black tea, but it's nice to have some oriental green tea for a change." He set the cup down and looked at Summer.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
