"I'm not the type to spoil my Pok\u233?mon. Too much cold food isn't good for them. Morpeko understands, right?" Marnie said as she stuffed another berry into Morpeko's mouth, muffling its protest.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After a short rest, they continued wandering aimlessly. Summer followed Marnie through various shops, noticing her growing excitement.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Eventually, they returned to the original bench. Marnie suddenly turned to Summer and said, "Hey, Summer, battle with me. Now that I'm in a good mood, I feel like battling. Show me how much you and Thwackey have grown."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
