"Thwackey~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Thwackey leapt forward, ready for battle. Marnie nodded and released her Pok\u233?mon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Liepard, let's win elegantly and swiftly for Marnie."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Liepard moved gracefully, its well-developed muscles hinting at its explosive power.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
