"Why did you stop?" the woman asked, disappointed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Do I look suspicious? My name is Perrin, a photographer hired by the Galar League to photograph Gym challengers. Are you not one? You both looked so passionate."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
