"Bastard!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The burly man grabbed the briefcase the old gentleman was holding, then threw the old man toward Summer and ran to the next carriage.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Thwackey, take care of it."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ow! The man's calf was hit by a flying stick, causing him to stumble and fall, looking nothing like his earlier arrogance.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"So cold!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"So strong!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"So beautiful!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
