"Then I vote no too," Lillie followed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hey, no," the man with accessories agreed nonchalantly, eager to end the meeting.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Understood. Let's adjourn."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With the professor's words, the device shut down, and the other holograms vanished. The professor reopened his book, titled *The Twin Heroes*.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
(End of Chapter)\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} 
