"As expected of the Diamond Clan leader, your awareness is really high."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Thanks for the compliment, but I asked about your identity with a purpose." Adaman stood up, picked up a wooden box, and opened it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Inside was an outfit similar in style to the robe Adaman wore, but it was badly worn. There were also miscellaneous daily items, several notebooks, and a finely crafted statue.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
