Returning to Hisui, he was very excited, believing he had traveled through time, which proved the existence of Sinnoh. When he shared this miraculous experience with the settlement, everyone was puzzled and speculated that the old man was hallucinating due to his excessive faith in Sinnoh, thinking he had traveled through time.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Adaman's grandfather was very stubborn and proud. When people refused to believe him, he was furious and never mentioned it again. People gradually forgot about it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
