"Did they return to his time together? Sorry, Sinnoh, I shouldn't have called you cruel." Adaman smiled, his eyes flashing with determination. "Alright, I need to work even harder. After all, we must make that future a reality!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
(End of Chapter)\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} 
