"You'll understand when you see more. Now, let me continue."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Opal listened intently, seemingly aspiring to be a gym leader. After Summer finished recounting the gym leaders he had met, Opal still wanted more. Gym leaders were indeed amazing people.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
