"Alright, I'll lead the way!" Hatterene, feeling like it found a savior, quickly led the way.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Without waking up Thwackey, Summer followed Hatterene to the Dream Forest. Upon entering, he immediately spotted a Shroomish. Due to its innate friendliness, this timid Pok\u233?mon didn't run away but curiously watched Summer.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
