86: Chapter 86: Hope from Bonds\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After reprimanding the Wishiwashi in the lake, Tapu Fini's stern expression faded. It then flew to Summer with Rillaboom.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"You've got a promising child here. Its aura reminds me of an old friend," Tapu Fini communicated telepathically to Summer.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Thank you for the compliment?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oh, by the way," Tapu Fini turned to the lake and waved its arm. A water-blue crystal emerged from the lake and flew into its hand.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
