"Thank you, kind child. I knew I wasn't wrong about you."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"It was nothing. Besides, it was you who took those dangerous Pok\u233?mon back to their original space. I should be the one thanking you," Summer replied.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"That's our duty. But tell me, why are you collecting so many Z-Crystals?" Tapu Fini's tone was curious.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Summer then explained what he had seen and learned in the town and that he was collecting Z-Crystals to awaken Tapu Lele.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
