"Look, Island Master Silver, at the scene behind you," Summer pointed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Silver turned to see the harmonious coexistence of people and Pok\u233?mon in the town, repairing their homes and expressing gratitude, forming bonds through their interactions.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
