After placing Tapu Lele on the small altar they had prepared, Silver Birch, with a heart full of gratitude, took a few steps forward, then turned to look at the Toucannon on his shoulder.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Please, Toucannon."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As a Flying and Normal-type Pok\u233?mon, Toucannon could use the move Seed Bomb, making it one of those chosen to help awaken Tapu Lele.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Toucannon chirped, telling him not to worry. They had been friends for so long, how could their bond not be strong enough?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Yes, you're right."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Silver replied softly. As the island master, he had to set a good example for everyone. Yes, there was no need to be nervous. Their bond was already unbreakable.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He recalled when he was just a boy and became partners with Toucannon, who was then a Pikipek. Pikipek had been attacked by a Talonflame and fell injured to the ground. Summoning courage from somewhere, he rescued it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In gratitude, Pikipek stayed by his side, growing up with him, sharing laughter and troubles, and facing punishment together, especially because Pikipek loved shiny objects and often took people's trinkets.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
