"Bloom brilliantly, flowers of vibrant colors!" Silver shouted, wishing for Alola's future to also bloom brightly!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Radiant Stone on his wrist shone with a strong light, transmitting energy to Toucannon, who felt an unprecedented vitality. It flapped its wings, and colorful flowers bloomed at its feet.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Harnessing the life force of the plants, Toucannon chirped and sent a green light into the sky, for making the flowers bloom was their true goal.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"We did it!" Silver said excitedly, immediately feeling all his strength drain away, just as Summer had described.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Tapu Lele seemed to sense the blooming flower field. Pink light particles floated from the flowers toward Tapu Lele, bringing joy to everyone's faces\u8212?it was working!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Island master, let me go next!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A young man with a Bulbasaur stepped forward. He wanted to contribute his energy to Tapu Lele because his grandfather, who had entrusted him with Bulbasaur, was suffering from injuries.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Alright, it's up to you now, young man!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Silver personally placed the Radiant Stone on his wrist. The young man earnestly mimicked Silver's dance and used the Z-Move.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
