"It seems you like your job. Finding your passion is rare. I'm glad I discovered my love for photography," Perrin smiled, raising her camera.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Well then, Summer, let's head to the next place!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hmm, so this is where you live," Perrin said, pressing the shutter.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Summer didn't take Perrin to the Dream Forest and Tropical Rainforest areas because they were hard to explain. After photographing other Pok\u233?mon in the forest, they arrived at the cabin.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Perrin, that's it for today. Let's take a break," Summer said.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
