Perrin turned, raising her camera.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I believe my photos can transcend time. No matter how long, people will smile when they see them. Photography is truly a miracle."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Thank you for listening to my musings, Summer. I'm leaving Galar tomorrow. Sunset Forest, as the last experience, was really nice."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I'm honored," Summer said.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"So let's add each other as friends. I'll share interesting photos with you," Perrin smiled, "like from my next destination, a northern village with a mysterious Pok\u233?mon!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
(End of chapter)\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} 
