99: Chapter 99: Space-Time Distortion in Kitakami Village\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
[Space-time distortion will commence in one minute. Please prepare yourselves.]\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
