The smell of earth, grass, and a serene tranquility filled the air. Summer opened his eyes and was stunned, muttering to himself:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Is this...?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
What he saw was not some extraordinary sight, but rather an ordinary bus stop.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The rusty sign, the old-fashioned bus shelter, and the wooden bench gave it a nostalgic feel, hinting at a time when buses had already existed for quite some time.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
