This seemed to be a relatively remote area, suggesting they could trace back the time further.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The sound of a bus horn interrupted his thoughts, and he stepped back to the bus stop. It made sense; where there was a bus stop, there would be a bus.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
