Kieran's face twisted in dislike at the mention of sticky rice cakes, and he stretched his hand out, chasing after her.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Sis! No!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Just then, a lighthearted voice came from behind Summer.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Haha, isn't youth wonderful?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"You are?" Summer turned to ask.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A blonde man had somehow appeared beside him, wearing a black jacket adorned with golden metal accessories that jingled as he moved.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In response to Summer's question, the man initially seemed surprised, then burst into laughter:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"The world is truly fascinating, isn't it? Haha\u8212?cough, cough. Sorry, you were asking my name. I'm Albert, a sort of traveler. And you?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
