Summer's eyes widened in realization. This wasn't the past but the future!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hey, why are you here?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Albert looked at Summer's thoughtful expression and Perrin's surprised face, sensing a brewing conflict. He waved his hand and said:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Summer... Well, good luck. I won't disturb you. I'm off~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He walked away quickly, muttering to himself, "Such ungrateful people~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Where does he think he's going...?" Summer sighed, watching Albert's retreating figure.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Arriving early and then pretending to meet by chance\u8212?are you secretly in love with me, Summer? You're really not being straightforward~" Perrin suddenly teased.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Summer fell silent, then replied, "Perrin, you and that guy aren't much different."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Haha, sorry, just kidding. So, what brings you to Mossui Town?" Perrin asked.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
