Taking a break? More like frequently, Summer thought silently.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But why didn't Perrin ask why I was here? She's usually not this absent-minded.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Wait, where's your Growlithe? Ah!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Seeing the bus about to leave, Perrin hurriedly chased after it, bringing her sleeping Growlithe down. Summer retracted his previous assessment\u8212?Perrin did seem a bit absent-minded.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
