"But you seem quite spirited."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Me?" Perrin lifted her camera and waved it in front of Summer. "There were so many interesting sights along the way. How could I miss them... ha-choo."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
