One day, the ogre went on a rampage and stormed into the village. At that moment, the three Pok\u233?mon\u8212?Okidogi, Munkidori, and Fezandipiti\u8212?were in the village. They fought desperately to drive the ogre back to the mountains.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
