"Kieran, be quiet! Didn't I say you could eat it after I win?!" Carmine clasped her hands before her chest, her expression becoming even more intimidating.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Well, it seems you've found a backer. Let's see how helpless you are in front of your sister." Carmine threw the Pok\u233? Ball from her waist.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A familiar Pok\u233?mon appeared in front of Summer\u8212?it was Morpeko, the ever-hungry Electric rodent.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
