104: Chapter 104: The Mask for the Ogre\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Kieran, that kid, has great talent," Summer muttered softly after bidding farewell to Kieran. He then turned to the Rillaboom waving goodbye and said, "Rillaboon, let's go. I'll take you on a mountain path we didn't walk during the day."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Rilla?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
