"This is something you cherish, right? Take good care of it."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Bo."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Through tear-filled eyes, the ogre saw the person in front of it. Unlike the people here, he didn't reject or fear it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The ogre took the mask from Summer and wore it again, then cried out energetically through its sobs.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Boni!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Yes, my name is Summer, and this is my partner, Rilla," Summer said gently, his demeanor as kind as the man's.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Rilla!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Rilla greeted the ogre. Its tall stature was as robust as the man's.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
