"Boni!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hearing Summer's words, the ogre ran to an open space, picked up a small stick, and carefully wrote in the dirt the only word the man taught it\u8212?its name.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
By moonlight, Summer read the words aloud:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ogerpon, huh? Is that your name?" Summer smiled at it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
