Munkidori knew quite a few moves, but Summer noticed one unfamiliar move, Tera Blast.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Tera Blast: Normal-type move. The move's type changes based on the Tera type.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
