After reviewing Munkidori's remaining information, Summer turned to Okidogi. Okidogi tensed up, but its tail wagged uncontrollably.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Okidogi, being strong isn't wrong, but using it recklessly is. From now on, you need to learn to control your strength. Being able to control your power is what makes a true strong Pok\u233?mon."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Okidogi!" The term "true strong Pok\u233?mon" made Okidogi's eyes sparkle.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"For instance, bullying the weak is a misuse of strength. Sometimes, you might struggle to control your emotions, so when we return, I'll take you to a place where you can find peace."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Okidogi nodded vigorously. Yes, it struggled to control its emotions and often became a rampaging brute.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Watchdog: A good dog. When intimidated, its attack increases, and it nullifies switching moves and items. Condition: Have a home it truly recognizes. Effect: Replaces ability with Watchdog, retaining the Poison Chain's effect while removing its influence.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Okidogi: Poison/Fighting type Pok\u233?mon. Moves: Howl, Tackle, Scary Face, Tera Blast, Roar, Bulk Up, Superpower, Counter, Poison Fang, Poison Jab, Bite, Crunch, Thrash, Outrage.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Most of Okidogi's moves were related to strength and roaring, fitting its previous personality.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
