"Don't worry, I'll find you some teachers. Learn humbly and then show your unparalleled charm."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Fezandipiti's expression softened. Once it filled the void in its heart, it would show Summer its true charm.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
