126: Chapter 126: Interrogating\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Jorio, a team leader under Macro Cosmos Energy, arrived near the Sunset Forest three hours ago with detection equipment. To remain inconspicuous, he avoided the main entrance, entering the forest from a secluded edge.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
About ten minutes into his walk, Jorio saw a tree trunk covered in talismans, which startled him. Cursing his bad luck, he kicked over the wooden sculpture placed in front of the tree.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
While catching his breath, Jorio noticed the intricacy of the fallen sculpture, thinking it would surely please Oleana.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
