"Exactly, seriousness has its perks!" Yagen said, looking around energetically. "Let's find a suitable burial place for it!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In the snowy field, a white Pok\u233?mon lay leisurely, swishing its thick, ice-crystal-covered tail. The raging blizzard felt like a comfortable massage to it. This Pok\u233?mon, known as Chien-Pao in the future, was recorded to freely play in the avalanches it caused.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Chien-Pao opened its deep blue eyes, looking happily at the Pok\u233?mon frozen in ice around it, their expressions of terror forever etched in that moment.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Howl~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
