155: Chapter 155: The Poisonous Feast\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At Rose Tower, Oleana, holding a report in hand, was briefing Chairman Rose on the latest happenings in Galar.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Chairman Rose, regarding the concert in Spikemuth\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
