"No, Chairman Rose. The energy fluctuations near Spikemuth have nothing to do with Dynamax energy. I'm currently focused on collecting Wishing Stars for your plan. I won't waste my energy on unnecessary matters." Oleana quickly replied.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Sorry for overworking you lately," Rose said with a gentle, apologetic smile.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Oleana tucked her hair behind her ear, shaking her head. "Compared to my previous research work, this is nothing. I'm more concerned about whether this will affect the progress of the Gym challengers."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Haha, so that's what's bothering you?" Rose shook his head helplessly. "It's only for three days. How much could it really affect?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
