"Well, that makes sense. With a concert being held in Spikemuth, it was pretty likely I'd run into you~. Didn't expect you to be working as staff though~," she said as she approached. "And your Thwackey has grown up too. Is this little one also your Pok\u233?mon? So cute~!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
