Marnie swallowed her words. Wasn't this that photographer from before? Since when did she get so familiar with Summer? Wait, where did Morpeko go? Oh, it had retreated into her bag.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"And Ogerpon too, hmm, looks like you're having a great time here," the photographer said, noticing the Pok\u233?mon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Marnie bit her lip. So, she knew Ogerpon too? Could it be that Summer caught Ogerpon because of her?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Bo-ni-o!" Ogerpon happily responded. Yes, every day was fun for Ogerpon!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Perrin, long time no see," Summer greeted her.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
