158: Chapter 158: Pheromosa\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In front of the wooden cabin, Summer sat on a wooden stool, flanked by two Pok\u233?mon\u8212?Hatterene and Vespiquen.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I see\u8230? so Pheromosa really is searching for something. A shining crystal\u8230? could it be a Z-Crystal?" Summer analyzed the intelligence brought back by the Combee.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Due to their species' traits, the Combee could only receive pheromone signals from Vespiquen. This was why they were able to return unharmed despite Pheromosa's control.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Because of this, they were the best scouts for investigating the tropical rainforest. That's why Summer had asked Vespiquen to command the Combee in gathering information.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
When Vespiquen heard that the intruder was a beautiful Bug-type Pok\u233?mon, she immediately accepted the request\u8212?no reason needed, she just didn't like the idea of another beauty around.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"If it really is a Z-Crystal, then we've found our bait," Summer nodded. With an Ultra Wormhole appearing, the presence of Alola's unique Z-Crystals wasn't surprising either.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Clasping his hands together, Summer gazed toward the tropical rainforest and murmured, "Since you've come to Sunset Forest, let's have some fun. Don't think you'll leave so easily, Pheromosa."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In the tropical rainforest, Ogerpon held the Z-Crystal that Summer had given it. The task assigned was simple\u8212?lure the controlled Pok\u233?mon and gather them in one place to prevent them from getting caught in the crossfire later.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Go ahead, Ogerpon."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Brimming with anticipation, Ogerpon heard Hatterene's voice. Acting as the communications officer for this operation, Hatterene's powerful psychic abilities allowed it to relay messages to every Pok\u233?mon in Sunset Forest.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Previously, it hadn't detected anything unusual simply because the emotional waves from a recent concert were too overwhelming. To avoid being affected, it had put itself into a deep sleep\u8212?otherwise, Dreamwood Forest might have been destroyed in the chaos.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Bo!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ogerpon dashed into the rainforest, raising the Z-Crystal high as it weaved through the controlled Pok\u233?mon. The moment they saw the crystal, they went berserk, frantically chasing after Ogerpon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With its agile movements, Ogerpon leaped effortlessly between tree trunks, playfully teasing the Pok\u233?mon behind it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Bonio!" {\i
Tag is so much fun!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At the rainforest's entrance, Milotic flicked its tail, waiting silently for Summer's signal. Its role was to block Pheromosa's escape\u8212?every side of the rainforest was enclosed by towering trees, leaving this as the only open exit.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
To ensure nothing slipped past, it had also shrouded the rainforest in a thick mist. No Pok\u233?mon would escape its notice.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Let it rain, Nana."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With a resigned sigh, Milotic accepted its nickname\u8212?it was stuck with it now. Humming softly, it summoned moisture into the air. Dark clouds gathered above the rainforest, and in an instant, heavy rain poured down.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Pheromosa's hypnosis relied on two factors: its beauty and the unique pheromones it released into the air.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This was why Summer had Milotic use {\i
Rain Dance}. The rain would significantly weaken Pheromosa's control over others.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At the heart of the rainforest, Pheromosa, seated on its berry throne, scowled at the gloomy sky. Its original world was nothing but dry desert.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Now, the rain drenched its pristine white body, leaving it irritated. Wet and sluggish, it would hinder its movements\u8212?unacceptable.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Annoyed, it glanced at the two Pok\u233?mon beside it and decided to vent its frustration.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
