Pheromosa was on the verge of losing it. It held back, reinforcing its hypnosis by forcing them to lock eyes with it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
These two were sturdy and strong, which was why it had kept them by its side. Yet now, even using them as stress relief was proving difficult.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Now, Trevenant\u8212?strike! Ogerpon has gathered them all in position."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In an instant, all the Pok\u233?mon chasing Ogerpon froze. Their legs were ensnared by roots, binding them tightly in place.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
