This game was a win for Ogerpon!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Trevenant cast its gaze over the rainforest. A few days ago, for some reason, the Pok\u233?mon of the Spirit Realm had suddenly gone into a frenzy, rushing toward the Spirit Realm's gate.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It had been forced to focus all its attention there, leaving Sunset Forest unchecked. Hopefully, today's battle would make up for that oversight.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Gaaawoo!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Through the pouring rain, a towering Ursaluna emerged before Pheromosa, holding up a Z-Crystal. The sight of it momentarily replaced its irritation with joy.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Pheromosa waved its arm, signaling Ursaluna to bring the crystal closer. But Ursaluna let out a disdainful scoff, smirking in provocation. {\i
You're a fool. In my eyes, you're not even worth a drop of honey.}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Phero?!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Pheromosa, having never been treated this way before, seethed with fury. It wanted nothing more than to stomp this bear into the ground. But with the irritating rain, it opted instead to command Okidogi and Fezandipiti to attack.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And then\u8212?Ursaluna ran.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Its task was simple: isolate Pheromosa from any support.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Watching its minions chase after Ursaluna, Pheromosa was left seething in the downpour. For a brief moment, it felt like the entire forest was against it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Boom. Boom. Boom.}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A rhythmic beat echoed through the rainforest. Pheromosa frowned and stepped down from its throne, sensing something was wrong.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Suddenly, three massive vines burst from the ground.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Gah!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
A grand entrance!} A frustrated screech rang from above. Pheromosa looked up\u8212?only to see a massive black bird descending from the sky, carrying a dark-furred monkey on its back.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Munkidori!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Look what I've got!} Munkidori lifted the Z-Crystal high. Pheromosa's gaze locked onto it, momentarily forgetting its surroundings.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Speed was Pheromosa's greatest advantage\u8212?but now, those vines had immobilized it completely. The outcome was inevitable.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Gaaaw!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Finally, it's my time to shine!} The black bird\u8212?Corviknight\u8212?roared.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Pheromosa, a Bug/Fighting-type, was quadruple weak to Flying-type attacks. And in this storm, {\i
Hurricane} was impossible to dodge.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Munkidori!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
This time, I will redeem myself!} Munkidori's Psychic-type attack was just as devastating. Its role was to land the finishing blow.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A {\i
Hurricane} and a {\i
Psychic} attack were launched simultaneously. From within the storm clouds, a swirling violet tornado descended upon Pheromosa. It struggled, but new vines ensnared it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The water-drenched air hammered against its body. Razor-sharp wind blades cut into its skin, while the psychic energy ravaged its mind.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gone was Pheromosa's usual arrogance. It let out a final, unwilling cry before collapsing.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
