Even stranger, Celebi couldn't see Summer's future\u8212?nor could it truly understand what kind of person he was.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The turning point was in this forest. Celebi didn't want to leave. But approaching such an unpredictable human was too dangerous. After thinking it over, Celebi made a decision\u8212?travel back in time.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
