However, Celebi now had a much better impression of Summer. Protecting the forest, being kind to Pok\u233?mon\u8212?these were all points in his favor. Without realizing it, Summer had already won over a Legendary Pok\u233?mon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Rillaboom, let it go. And\u8230? sorry about that, Celebi. For, uh, borrowing your name without permission."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hearing its name, Rillaboom quickly withdrew its roots. This was the so-called "Forest Guardian" Summer had mentioned before?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Celebi fluttered into the air, wings shimmering as it gave a small nod\u8212?that's more like it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
For the first time, Celebi looked directly at Summer. And for some reason, the more it looked, the more pleasant it found him. The whole getting-captured thing? Already forgotten.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Arms crossed, Celebi began thinking.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Since the moment Summer arrived in Sunset Forest, he had time-traveled seven times, and every time, the forest changed. There was no doubt\u8212?Summer was blessed with extraordinary power, not just over time, but space as well.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
No wonder the turning point appeared in this forest.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But the question was\u8230? who did this power truly belong to? If it was him\u8212?the man Celebi had seen in its vision\u8212?the consequences would be disastrous.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"\u8230?Can I ask why you specifically traveled back in time just to watch me?" Summer asked.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ogerpon covered its mouth. That sounds just like a stalker\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Realizing the misunderstanding, Celebi frantically waved its hands. I was just evaluating your character! How could saving the world be considered being a stalker?!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ogerpon, however, remained unconvinced, giving Celebi a deeply suspicious look. Since it lacked telepathy, Celebi had to go through quite a bit of effort to explain the whole situation to Summer.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"So, let me get this straight," Summer said, summarizing everything.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Someone is trying to capture you and use your powers to rewrite history, creating a dark future. You came to Sunset Forest searching for a way to prevent that future from happening. And you found me. But because you didn't understand my powers, you went back in time to investigate me."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Celebi nodded. That was exactly it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"\u8230?So, does that mean I passed your evaluation?" Summer asked.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Celebi nodded again\u8212?because it had seen the story of this forest.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The timid, self-doubting Grookey who grew into a Rillaboom capable of protecting its home. The ambitious Rookidee who finally achieved its dream. The young Phantump who made its own choices.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The once-lonely Hatterene who found true friendship. The Lilligant who danced freely. The Ogerpon who was no longer shackled by its past.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Milotic who discovered its purpose. The Ursaluna who finally smiled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Celebi hadn't just been watching Summer\u8212?it had been watching all of Sunset Forest's Pok\u233?mon. And at the center of all these changes\u8230? was him.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But it wasn't just Pok\u233?mon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
People, too.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Marnie, who had grown stronger.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gideon, who seemed to be aging backward from joy.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Nessa, who had rediscovered her creative spark.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The model who found clarity.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The martial artist who overcame his doubts.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The masked boy who made his first friend.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And every single uninvited guest that had been dealt with.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Celebi had witnessed it all.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It extended its tiny hand, looking into Summer's eyes with its pale blue gaze.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Will you help me save the world?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ah, of course I will," Summer replied, without hesitation. "I don't want to see Sunset Forest\u8212?or anyone here\u8212?disappear. I don't want all the effort I've witnessed to be erased."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Reaching out, he gently grasped Celebi's hand. At that moment, a silent agreement was made. Together, they would stop the man from Celebi's vision. They would ensure history stayed on the right path.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"In that case, Celebi\u8230? stay here. Let Sunset Forest become your home\u8212?your shield of protection." Summer smiled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Celebi was deeply moved and wanted to nod immediately, but it had its mission. It couldn't stay in one place forever.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
For Celebi, there was no past or future\u8212?only the present. To maintain its energy, it needed to absorb time ripples from the most active point in time\u8212?something it called "the Now."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was said that the heartbeat of the god of time determined the placement of this Now. And where it was\u8230? that was where Celebi had to be.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
So, reluctantly, Celebi explained its dilemma.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"\u8230?Then just make Sunset Forest your permanent Now," Summer said simply. "Stay here, until the problem is solved. Let your kind handle the future part."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Celebi's eyes widened in realization. It could do that.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It would only have to monitor the past\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
