Summer grinned. "A shrine that preserves the power of time, maybe? I am pretty confident in my woodworking skills."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Celebi blinked. That\u8230? could actually work.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A small smile formed on its face.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
I never expected this\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Sunset Forest has become my home.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The future\u8230? suddenly seems so much more interesting.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
