A great Pok\u233?mon. Gentle-natured, plays the drums well, treats all Pok\u233?mon in the forest kindly, and is willing to protect those he cares about\u8212?no matter the cost.}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Celebi's continuous praise made Rillaboom scratch its head in embarrassment. {\i
I mean, that's just what I'm supposed to do\u8230?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Summer smiled. "I think so too. Thanks, Celebi. Be careful while traveling through time."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Celebi blinked. {\i
Why thank me?} Summer always seemed calm and level-headed, but sometimes, he was just impossible to understand.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
