{\i
So Celebi's recognition really was the key!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Rillaboom, too, immediately sensed the change. Without effort, it could now spread {\i
Grassy Terrain} whenever it wanted. Life energy pulsed through its deep brown fur and vibrant green leaves\u8212?whenever it willed it, the energy would spread, blanketing the ground in lush grass.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Rilla?!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
