Including him.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But imagining Ogerpon as a responsible big sister was\u8230? difficult.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A fierce protector, sure. But a loving, nurturing sister?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The mental image of Ogerpon swinging her club like a gang leader flashed through Summer's mind.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He smirked.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
