"Bo\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Reluctantly, Ogerpon placed the incubator on the table. Between staying with the egg and traveling with Summer, she ultimately chose the latter.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Let's wait outside. One more minute to go."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Summer and his two Pok\u233?mon stepped out of the cabin. As the light engulfed them, his surroundings began to shift.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Again?!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The moment he landed, Summer was hit by a bone-chilling cold.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Fortunately, this time he wasn't in the middle of a blizzard.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Opening his eyes, he found himself standing in the middle of an expansive, snow-covered tundra. The ground stretched endlessly in all directions, its pure white surface glistening under the sunlight.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
