Unlike its modern counterpart, its body wasn't made of ice, but solid rock.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Everything confirmed it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Just as I thought\u8230?" Summer muttered.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"This is Hisui."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And this tundra\u8212?Pure White Tundra.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
No wonder it felt familiar.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"\u8230?But I can't tell when this is." His gaze turned northward.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Pearl Clan was supposed to reside by the northern rivers.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If they existed here, then that meant\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He might get to see Adaman and Arezu again.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
