And then\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Nothing.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
No legendary artifact.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
No miracle item.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Just stacks upon stacks of\u8230? white envelopes.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"\u8230?Bonii???"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A mix of confusion and disappointment spread across Ogerpon's face. {\i
Where's the rare treasure?!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
