211: Chapter 211: Fulfilling the Promise\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In front of the forest cabin, the entire Nuzleaf tribe had gathered, perching on the canopy of nearby trees. Some stood with arms crossed, others sat swinging their legs, while a few hung effortlessly from branches with one arm.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Today, Summer was set to fulfill a long-standing promise\u8212?to award a Leaf Stone to the most outstanding Nuzleaf. It was no surprise that they had all assembled so neatly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Clearing his throat, Summer addressed the group.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"A few days ago, Sunset Forest was invaded by bad people. I saw everything you did, and I know how hard you all fought. To honor our agreement, I will now grant the Leaf Stone to one of you."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
