"Bonii~!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ogerpon raised her hand, holding another Leaf Stone.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Yes, apart from the one he had obtained from the Time-Space Distortions, Summer had received a full set of evolution stones from Galar's League\u8212?including two Leaf Stones.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"You don't have to refuse each other anymore," Summer chuckled. "I've been watching you too. The one who's always perched outside my cabin, training. I assume you earned your comrade's approval?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The scarred Nuzleaf looked stunned. {\i
He remembered me\u8230??}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The surrounding Nuzleaf began cheering, urging them both to step forward and accept their reward.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even Okidogi and Oranguru joined in. The former, proud that it had also guessed correctly, and the latter smugly waving its fan\u8212?content that it had beaten Corviknight in their little mental contest.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The two Nuzleaf leapt down from the treetops, approaching Summer.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Here," Summer knelt down, holding the Leaf Stones toward them. "This is the reward you both earned."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
They exchanged one last glance, then simultaneously reached out.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A brilliant light engulfed them.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Their hair grew long and white like a waterfall, wooden geta sandals formed at their feet, and their hands became three-leafed fans. As the cold wind howled, the light faded\u8212?revealing two newly evolved Shiftry.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
One still had its oversized leaf fan, while the other retained its jagged cut\u8212?each carrying traces of their past selves.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
