233: Chapter 233: A Visitor\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After concluding his journey in Kitakami, Summer and his Pok\u233?mon returned to the familiar Sunset Forest.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
