253: Chapter 253: Kubfu\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ha ha ha! Looks like I lost this one," Mustard chuckled, though there was no frustration on his face\u8212?only genuine delight. "But I sure got to see some fascinating things today!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
